div.p:
“1. NAC, pursuant to their res on 19 Dec 1950 (Doc C6–D5 (final)), having considered certain proposals for reorg and simplification of structure of NATO put forward by Canadian rep together with other related proposals, have agreed that provisions set out below shall replace: (a)
Sections I, II, III, VII and VIII of report of WG on org, as adopted by Council on 17 Sept, 1949;
(b)
Directive from NAC to DFEC (doc. Council D–1/4, 18 Nov, 1949);
(c)
Directive from NAC to MPSB (doc. Council D–1/5, 18 Nov, 1949);
(d)
Council res No. 4/7, 17 May, 1950 setting up NACD.
